      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i feel like the pain is just dull, not like a sharp emergency or anything. and i looked up some stuff online and people say it's really common to have some stiffness and weird sensations for a couple weeks. if i just stay in bed and keep taking my regular meds and maybe some heating pads, wouldn't that be safer than going to a scary hospital where they might perform more surgery? can't i just wait until morning to see if it gets better?",
